 this': flydubai pilot Capt Smit Machchar recounts cockpit attack]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-something-you-cant-die-like-this-flydubai-pilot-capt-smit-machchar-recounts-cockpit-attack/articleshow/135019095.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135019095.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-something-you-cant-die-like-this-flydubai-pilot-capt-smit-machchar-recounts-cockpit-attack/articleshow/135019095.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-something-you-cant-die-like-this-flydubai-pilot-capt-smit-machchar-recounts-cockpit-attack/articleshow/135019095.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T23:55:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Manju V</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135019137,imgsize-224188.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['He kept on hitting': Indian flydubai pilot Smit Machchhar reveals what happened mid-flight as he was stabbed]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/he-kept-on-hitting-indian-flydubai-pilot-smit-machchhar-reveals-what-happened-mid-flight-as-he-was-stabbed/articleshow/135018356.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135018356.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Smit Machchhar was attacked by his co-pilot during a routine Flydubai flight, which he initially misinterpreted. As he attempted to defend himself, he lost consciousness amidst his desperate fight for survival. Other crew members intervened and helped regain control of the aircraft after he opened the cockpit door. The pilot expressed gratitude for the medical treatment he received after safely landing in Saudi Arabia.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/he-kept-on-hitting-indian-flydubai-pilot-smit-machchhar-reveals-what-happened-mid-flight-as-he-was-stabbed/articleshow/135018356.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/he-kept-on-hitting-indian-flydubai-pilot-smit-machchhar-reveals-what-happened-mid-flight-as-he-was-stabbed/articleshow/135018356.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T23:20:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135018586,imgsize-94948.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['AIADMK would welcome Dhanush with both hands', says Rajendra Balaji]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiadmk-would-welcome-dhanush-with-both-hands-says-rajendra-balaji/articleshow/135018032.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135018032.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During a recent press conference, AIADMK leader K T Rajendra Balaji expressed enthusiasm about actor Dhanush possibly entering politics. He mentioned that the party would gladly accept Dhanush's involvement, highlighting the significant appeal actors like him have over the youth. Additionally, it was observed that Dhanush has rebranded his fan club to align with his evolving public persona, showcasing his readiness for greater engagement.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiadmk-would-welcome-dhanush-with-both-hands-says-rajendra-balaji/articleshow/135018032.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiadmk-would-welcome-dhanush-with-both-hands-says-rajendra-balaji/articleshow/135018032.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T23:00:23+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135018223,imgsize-57497.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Thoughts with those who have lost their loved ones': PM Modi on Kolkata stampede]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thoughts-with-those-who-have-lost-their-loved-ones-pm-modi-on-kolkata-stampede/articleshow/135017835.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135017835.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The incident occurred around 7.40 pm in the Girish Park police station area amid heavy crowds of pandal visitors and rainfall. As rain began, people waiting outside the pandal rushed forward, causing some to fall on the road and triggering a stampede, a senior police officer told PTI. All the injured were rescued and taken to Calcutta Medical College for treatment.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thoughts-with-those-who-have-lost-their-loved-ones-pm-modi-on-kolkata-stampede/articleshow/135017835.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thoughts-with-those-who-have-lost-their-loved-ones-pm-modi-on-kolkata-stampede/articleshow/135017835.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T22:57:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135018051,imgsize-911375.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kolkata Durga Puja Stampede: 19 dead; PM Modi, Amit Shah, Rahul Gandhi, Mamata Banerjee express grief]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/kolkata-durga-puja-stampede-pm-modi-amit-shah-mamata-express-grief/articleshow/135017733.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135017733.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a heartbreaking incident at a Durga Puja pandal in north Kolkata, a stampede claimed the lives of at least 19 people and left 25 others injured amid a surge of visitors driven by panic from heavy rains. Rescue efforts were promptly initiated, and medical staff rushed the injured to hospitals.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/kolkata-durga-puja-stampede-pm-modi-amit-shah-mamata-express-grief/articleshow/135017733.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/kolkata-durga-puja-stampede-pm-modi-amit-shah-mamata-express-grief/articleshow/135017733.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T22:52:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135017840,imgsize-68846.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sabarimala temple opens for Thulam month rituals; CM Satheesan offers prayers]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sabarimala-temple-opens-for-thulam-month-rituals-cm-satheesan-offers-prayers/articleshow/135016954.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135016954.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The revered Sabarimala Lord Ayyappa temple was opened on Saturday for the rituals of the Thulam month, drawing numerous devotees eager to pay their respects. Kerala Chief Minister V D Satheesan, along with other esteemed guests, visited the shrine for prayers. The temple's opening for devotees is scheduled for 5 am on Sunday, coinciding with Mahanavami and Vijayadashami, a unique occurrence in many decades.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sabarimala-temple-opens-for-thulam-month-rituals-cm-satheesan-offers-prayers/articleshow/135016954.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sabarimala-temple-opens-for-thulam-month-rituals-cm-satheesan-offers-prayers/articleshow/135016954.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T22:36:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135017615,imgsize-100056.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kolkata pandal stampede: Heavy rush amid rain led to deadly incident - top developments]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/kolkata-pandal-stampede-heavy-rush-amid-rain-led-to-deadly-incident-top-developments/articleshow/135017310.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135017310.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[A chaotic stampede unfolded at the Sarada Park Durga Puja pandal in north Kolkata due to a crowd surge, leading to at least 1 deaths and 15 injuries. Emergency services transported the injured to Calcutta Medical College and Hospital for immediate medical assistance. The West Bengal health minister, alongside other political leaders, responded by visiting the scene and the hospital.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/kolkata-pandal-stampede-heavy-rush-amid-rain-led-to-deadly-incident-top-developments/articleshow/135017310.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/kolkata-pandal-stampede-heavy-rush-amid-rain-led-to-deadly-incident-top-developments/articleshow/135017310.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T22:28:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135017470,imgsize-2050862.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tamil Nadu BJP slams ministers for allowing Muslim aide in skull cap into temple]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/tamil-nadu-bjp-slams-ministers-for-allowing-muslim-aide-in-skull-cap-into-temple/articleshow/135017190.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135017190.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The BJP alleged that the incident, which took place on Saturday, went against a Madras high court order issued in January 2024 that restricts non-Hindus from proceeding beyond the temple’s flagmast unless they submit an undertaking affirming their faith in the deity and their willingness to follow Hindu customs. The party also claimed that the entry violated the temple’s dress code and religious traditions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/tamil-nadu-bjp-slams-ministers-for-allowing-muslim-aide-in-skull-cap-into-temple/articleshow/135017190.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/tamil-nadu-bjp-slams-ministers-for-allowing-muslim-aide-in-skull-cap-into-temple/articleshow/135017190.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T22:15:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135017265,imgsize-68250.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Taking away right to vote, protest’: Uddhav backs opposition's ‘regime change’ call against government]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/taking-away-right-to-vote-protest-uddhav-backs-oppositions-regime-change-call-against-government/articleshow/135017025.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135017025.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/taking-away-right-to-vote-protest-uddhav-backs-oppositions-regime-change-call-against-government/articleshow/135017025.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/taking-away-right-to-vote-protest-uddhav-backs-oppositions-regime-change-cal